WEBVTT

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.320
Wow! Falulu's gotten so popular!

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.440
So radiant!

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:15.410
Certainly, her Idol Glow Index, Charisma Index, and Fan Cheer Index

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.620
have all more than tripled.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.620
More than tripled? Amazing!

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.500
But we can't afford to keep losing!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.980
We'll have her admit defeat!

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.360
Well, duh!

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.170
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.180
That said, how will we do it?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.170
I think we need more dance practice.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.380
Well we gotta do something.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.340
No point just sitting here.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.670
I thought you'd say... But that alone...

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.610
It has been far too long,

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.150
Toudou Shion.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.020
You're...

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.320
Who's that?

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:59.580
Indeed, no one could forget after seeing you...

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.040
Your eternal rival, Kagawa Iroha.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.020
Also known as...

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.710
The Go Society's <i>Lady Kagawa!</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.920
The Go Society's <i>Lady Kagawa?!</i>

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:49.740
Committed to the image...

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:50.990
So cool!

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:52.310
Looks like she's good at go!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.730
Looks strong.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:56.250
Oh, you exaggerate.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:01.560
In the five years Toudou Shion ruled the Go Championships,

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.410
I didn't win a single game against her.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.270
Eh?

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.480
Didn't win once? And you're her rival?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.620
Dorothy...

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.990
Unrivaled!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:15.220
That is simply how strong I was.

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.440
Singing my own praise...

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.890
Just saying, before you do.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:18.840
Yep.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.920
Wow, you were that strong?

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:24.450
As befits our teammate!

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.020
That's really amazing, Shion!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.550
That's in the past.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.010
Indeed. That is all in the past now.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.310
You have changed of late, Shion.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.520
What are you saying, Iroha?

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:39.990
You used to radiate the allure of the lone wolf.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:51.120
But since forming this team,
Dressing Pafé, you have gone soft.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.560
I've gone soft?

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:54.580
Like heck she has!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:55.790
No!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:04:01.010
Eating a disgustingly sweet fruit parfait is proof enough!

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:06.110
You used to eat only black-and-white things.

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:11.230
Certainly, before I would order only bean daifuku or coffee jelly.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:14.940
And that is why you lost to that Falulu.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:19.460
I would certainly not lose to you in your current state.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.490
A letter of challenge?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.150
Indeed.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:26.870
I challenge you to a go match inside PriPara tomorrow.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.950
Huh? Go in PriPara?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.140
Not a concert?

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:34.830
Our rivalry is purely over go.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:39.550
I refuse. My life is devoted to attaining Divine Idolhood.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.000
I was afraid you might say so.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:48.570
But I proposed a new program idea involving go to Ms. Meganee.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:50.410
Program idea?

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:54.020
Yes. And her response...

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.110
<i>Sounds good.</i>

00:04:57.110 --> 00:05:01.980
<i>Consider your "New Year's PriPara Go-Panda Showdown!" approved.</i>

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.450
was in the affirmative.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.340
"Go-Panda Showdown?"

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.200
Panda?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.380
That sounds fun!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.640
Why panda?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:14.180
As such, I sincerely hope you will come face me in PriPara tomorrow.

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.510
What are you gonna do, Shion?

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:19.960
You can't really back down if it's in PriPara...

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:28.130
Very well. I accept your challenge.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.050
I look forward to it.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.790
<i>Survival of the fittest.</i>

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:43.720
<i>Back when I believed the strong would always win.</i>

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:47.860
The strong...

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:53.480
<i>There must be some way to defeat Falulu.</i>

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.160
<i>But I can't read ahead?!</i>

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.420
<i>You have become soft!</i>

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:06.320
Impossible! I stand by my word!

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.180
I will prove I'm as strong as ever!

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:11.480
Shion!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.100
I'm coming to see the Go Panda Showdown!

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.750
Beat her good!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.540
Do your best!

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.810
Thank you.

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.930
Shion! We'll be watching on TV!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.120
Fight-pri!

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.640
Go get 'em.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.970
Hey! How long d'you think this break is-kuma?

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.280
Practice starts now-kuma! Go go <i>go!</i>

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.390
Okay.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:32.680
Pri.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.420
Pshu.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.880
You worry too much.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:37.740
I just need to remain calm and collected.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.320
Come on, try to get a little fired up-kuma!

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.470
Capisce!

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:44.310
Lala, what is "getting fired up"?

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:44.750
Eh?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.610
Falulu!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:49.970
Uhh, getting fired up is like...

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:53.350
Fired, fired, fired up!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.430
Just like that!

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.640
Fired, fired, fired up.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.140
Louder!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.670
Fired, fired, fired up!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.110
Like that! Huh?

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.620
Falulu?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:06.110
She's gone-kuma.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.070
What?

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.820
She's super mysterious.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:11.240
Sure is.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:14.490
Falulu's a Vocal Doll so she doesn't do that!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.670
I do wonder what a Vocal Doll is...

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.310
You're slipping out of character again-kuma.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.460
Pop Step Gotcha!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.920
I remember-kuma!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.800
A Vocal Doll is a Doll that's Vocal-kuma!

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.740
PriPara has many urban legends-kuma!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:41.850
Vocal Dolls are one of those. It's said they are beings born in PriPara.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.330
Born in PriPara?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.000
Does that happen?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.200
Well, it's an urban legend.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:54.320
And it's said they're born with characteristics perfectly suited for reaching the very top of the idol world.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.100
Perfectly suited for reaching the top of the idol world?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.360
Sounds impressive.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.540
Feels so good to remember!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:04.500
Are you saying we have no hope of beating Falulu?

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:07.710
It's too early to give up before we try!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.400
True... Okay! Let's do this-pri!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.920
Leona was worried you might be nervous.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:20.350
So we'll walk you to the studio. It's on our way anyway.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.470
Relax, Shion!

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.940
I'll be fine.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.210
Shion.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.070
Good morning.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:28.830
Who?

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:29.440
Iroha.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.490
Huh? You transformed to look more plain?
Is that even a thing?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:39.490
Miss Meganee said this is my true face. In truth, it's rather embarrassing...

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.620
I think it's very cute!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.460
Thank you.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.570
I will face you unadorned.

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.750
What is "unadorned"?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.210
Falulu?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.510
You don't even know that?

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.710
How old are you, anyway?

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:57.190
Unicorn said I'm about ten now.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.960
About as old as Lala, then.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.800
I guess I wouldn't expect you to know.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:03.180
Really?

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.190
Who are you?

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:07.410
Ah, I'm—Tension Max!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:10.150
Super attractive! Name's Dorothy!

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:15.110
What is "Tension Max Super Attractive?"

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:18.260
Can't you see just by looking at me?

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:20.330
Dodothy! Tension Relax!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.580
Tension Relax.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.100
You don't get to give me that!

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.750
Calm and collected!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.290
What's calm and collected?

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:34.740
How about you get a dictionary instead of pestering people with every little thing you don't know?

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:35.510
Dictionary?

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:41.040
If you're particularly interested in idioms, I'd recommend an idiom dictionary.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.560
Idiot frictionary?

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:44.000
An idiom dictionary.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.020
Idiom dictionary

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:53.440
Idiom dictionary, tension max relax super attractive. Got it.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.400
Stop copying people!

00:09:57.670 --> 00:10:01.610
We really lost to that clueless little girl on stage? Why?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.370
The New Year's PriPara Go Panda Showdown!

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:13.010
People all over the world watching PriPara TV:

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.260
Welcome!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:20.430
Toudou Shion and Kagawa Iroha's PriPara Go Panda Showdown is about to start!

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:28.640
And the winner gets—oh my—an all new Cyalume Coord presented by Houjou Cosmo herself!

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.030
Isn't that right, Miss Cosmo?

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:32.900
Hi! Hello everybody!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:36.860
I'm particularly happy with this new Cyalume Coord,

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:40.820
so you'd better put some super cosmic effort into winning it!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.080
Well then, are our competitors all ready?

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.650
How about our pandas?

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.710
Totally real pandas!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:53.920
White pandas-panda!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.200
Black pandas-panda!

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:06.220
And there they go into their bowls. We're all ready!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.550
Good luck.

00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:10.340
Match Start!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.940
But before that, we have to cut to commercials.

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:23.560
Black player: Iroha.

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:25.330
4-27.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:32.990
White player: Shion.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:36.920
I see it!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.380
4-4!

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.760
16-16.

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:48.100
17-4!

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.690
15-4.

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.150
15-3!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.520
14-3.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.360
16-3!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.570
13-4.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.360
17-6!

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.760
How's it going?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.480
What is it, Mr. Usagi?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.240
It ain't going... I only approved this because I thought it'd be good marketing for Dressing Pafé.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:20.920
And it's already as good as over!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.130
Neat, Shion's already winning?

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.340
Ya got it backwards-usa! She's losing-usa!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.090
What?!

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:31.390
Toudou Shion's hand has been stopped for nearly 3 minutes.

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:39.860
<i>Why? I can't see the next move no matter what...</i>

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.860
Is Shion gonna be okay?

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.370
Her next move will tell that-pri.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:46.710
What? You mean...

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:48.540
Shion's in a dead-end-pri.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:49.540
No way...

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.460
<i>Have I gone soft after all?</i>

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:00.460
The unbeatable world champion...

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.920
Is she gonna lose?

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.130
<i>Right...</i>

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.980
<i>If I can't read the next move, I have a 90% chance of losing.</i>

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:11.510
<i>I can read that much.</i>

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.740
I can't hold it in!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.410
No fair-panda!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.790
I can't either!

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.870
I gotta pee too!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.600
Here we come, toilet!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:35.240
There's no way around a physiological need.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.270
Please keep watching after these commercials.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:46.970
Shion!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.170
What are you doing?

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:50.880
Dorothy! Leona!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:53.560
You'd better win! You'll embarrass us if you lose!

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.850
Dorothy...

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.680
I understand that.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:14:00.090
But the game knows no mercy.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.400
Shion...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.230
If I can't read ahead, I'm done for.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.070
If you can't read, try harder! Again and again!

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:12.030
Desperate struggle, touch and go, every which way...

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.610
Outside perspective.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.640
Pipe down, you!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.870
We don't have time for your nonsense!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.350
Beyond compare, beyond one's grasp...

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:23.710
One of a kind, bring it on...

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:25.900
Max Max!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.140
Relax!

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:30.510
We're working our hardest with the dance steps too!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.140
I understand...

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:36.240
But I can't read what I can't read.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.250
That's nothing like you! Just read it somehow!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.150
I can't!

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.560
So you agree with what she said?

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:47.530
<i>But since forming this team,
Dressing Pafé, you have gone soft.</i>

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.150
That being with us has made you weak?

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:52.410
What the heck have we been doing all this time?!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:52.990
Relax, Dorothy!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:53.830
You gotta win!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:54.790
Relax, Dorothy!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.840
I see it! I must change my approach...

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.920
An outside perspective!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.350
Looking at the situation objectively has shown me the way!

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:20.560
Three dimensions! The three of our three-person team!

00:15:20.970 --> 00:15:21.430
Huh?

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:22.680
You figured it out?

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.980
Alright then!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:24.230
Okay!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:26.400
Let's <i>go!</i>

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.480
Feeling good-kuro!

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:40.290
Much better-shiro!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.340
Has everyone found their places?

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:45.260
Panda!

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:47.250
With that, let's continue our showdown!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:51.180
Good luck.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.410
17-8!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.990
A return from the brink... A truly godlike play.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:14.320
I resign. I have lost.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:19.290
Incredibly, Toudou Shion turned the seemingly impossible odds to her favor and stole victory!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.900
All right!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.250
Heck yeah-pri!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:26.590
Iroha, this victory was possible because of Dressing Pafé.

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:31.800
Working together with friends makes me stronger than I was alone.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.520
This is my new form of fighting.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:38.510
Make sure you see our show today.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.980
Very well.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.440
Congratulations, Shion!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.670
That was cosmic amazing!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:47.650
Here!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.440
Thank you very much!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:52.860
It was a victory three of us worked for, so I want three sets!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.450
Of course. I have some for Dorothy and Leona too.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.930
A new Cyalume Coord. Present For You!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.330
Today's victory is as much yours as it is mine.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:08.460
Of course it is. We ain't Dressing Pafé for nothing!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.790
Right, Leona?

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.800
If you say so, Dorothy!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:17.190
All right now! Let's turn this victory into a show that won't lose even to Falulu-usa!

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:17.690
Understood!
Yeah!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:23.000
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:27.310
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.280
Coord Change Start!

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.260
A return to the China Rock Dress.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.160
The blue is this winter's new option.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:39.830
China Rock Cool Dress!

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.490
<i>Go!</i>

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.580
The pandas seem cuter than normal today.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.830
I wonder why.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.340
China Rock Honey Dress!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.000
Yay!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:58.260
Make this Go Panda Showdown Finale one to remember!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.850
China Rock Forest Dress!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.850
<i>I won't waver again.</i>

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.770
<i>Sturm und Drang. We can pass through any storm unscathed!</i>

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:55.030
<i>Beyond compare! Other teams will stand no chance!</i>

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.200
<i>Three as one! Our unity makes us strong!</i>

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.760
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:44.860
Stereo Full Blast! 2-3-Rock!

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:47.340
Let's <i>go!</i>

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.080
Cyalume Change!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:58.450
Yay!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.170
<i>Go!</i>

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:39.960
Still too soft... But a wonderful performance nevertheless.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:44.340
I should expect no less of my rival, Toudou Shion.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:48.280
Wherever you walk, victory isn't far behind.

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:52.060
But one day I will claim a victory against you.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:53.520
Very well.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:59.300
Challenge accepted. And you helped me discover something important today.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.480
My undying gratitude!

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.200
Undying gratitude, good.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:08.340
And Falulu, I did not expect to, but I have also seen the truth in your words.

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:11.450
My thanks. But that's that...

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.480
As a rival, I will defeat you as well as SoLaMi!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.670
That's right!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:16.170
Yeah!

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:18.300
What are you on about?

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:20.930
You aren't fit to kiss Falulu's boots!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.230
Keep dreaming, losers!

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:26.130
Falulu, I've been looking for you. Let's go!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:31.820
Undying gratitude, Falulu is waiting!

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:08.070
Dressing Pafé's doing great!

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:10.790
We should do something cool with our show too!

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:13.100
I'll do a somersault!

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:14.240
<i>You </i>will?

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.910
Have no fear-glo!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.210
Headmistress?

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:20.580
No, you shall call me <i>instructor!</i>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.060
I will whip SoLaMi SMILE into shape! I hope you're ready!

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:27.280
Scary, but capisce!

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:28.630
I'll do my best-glo!

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:31.460
Next time: EZ DO Gloxercise
